{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55450","headline":"拟寒山 七 · 泰钦","name":"拟寒山 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽岩我自悟，路险无人到。\n寒烧带叶柴，倦即和衣倒。\n闲牕任月明，落叶从风扫。\n住兹不计年，渐觉垂垂老。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"泰钦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55450.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55450","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}